config BR2_PACKAGE_CTF
	bool "ctf"
	depends on BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_PLATFORM_BCM53XX
	help
	  Cut-through forwarding for bgmac: an open-source take on
	  Broadcom's CTF for Northstar (BCM4708/4709) routers.

	  Builds ctf.ko, which makes bgmac a netfilter flowtable
	  "hardware" offload target. Flows the flowtable offloads are
	  forwarded straight from bgmac's receive path, skipping GRO,
	  the DSA receive path, RPS and the netfilter ingress hook.
	  Selected with "Hardware flow offloading" in the web UI.

	  Needs the bgmac offload hook, which the bcm53xx kernel
	  carries as linux-patches/00003-bgmac-offload-hook.patch.

	  https://github.com/tomato64/ctf
